			title: "Crates and Drums"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0E9F2E59FE951229"]
			description: ["Build the chest yourself: a hollow cube of &6Chest Walls&r with one &6Core&r among them is one giant inventory, and &6Interfaces&r set into the walls let pipes reach it. The upgrade tool swaps the material later without emptying it."]
