		{
			dependencies: ["55D3B1D14B8BCE80"]
			description: [
				"A &6drawer&r stores a lot of one item behind its face. Right-click puts in what you hold, a quick double right-click puts in every matching item you carry, and left-click takes a stack back out."
				"Planks around a chest make one: the 1x1 holds the most of a single item, the 2x2 four kinds."
